us operation for Claude Code workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-05-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph\" target=\"_blank\">CodeGraph</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Pre-indexed code knowledge graph for AI coding agents. Provides semantic code intelligence with 35% cost reduction, 70% fewer tool calls, and 100% local operation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-05-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates (8)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.150</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Release</span>\n                        Internal infrastructure improvements with no user-facing changes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-23</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.149</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Added `/usage` per-category breakdown, `/diff` keyboard scrolling, GFM task list checkbox rendering, enterprise managed setting for cloud MCP connectors, and security fixes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-22</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.148</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Bugfix</span>\n                        Fixed Bash tool returning exit code 127 on every command for some users.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-22</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.147</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Pinned background sessions now stay alive when idle, `/simplify` renamed to `/code-review`, improved auto-updater with retry logic.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-21</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.44.0-nightly</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        RAG debugging, auth fixes, proxy improvements, and NixOS sandbox fixes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-15</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.44.0-nightly</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Agent refactor, Auto mode merge, OAuth improvements, and context file enhancements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-14</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.42.0-nightly</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Context improvements, routing fixes, and extension installation from SSH repos.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-12</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.145</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                        Added `claude agents --json` for scripting, status line JSON input improvements, and plugin discover screens.\n                 