uous operation for Claude Code workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-05-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph\" target=\"_blank\">CodeGraph</a>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Pre-indexed code knowledge graph for AI coding agents. Provides semantic code intelligence with 35% cost reduction, 70% fewer tool calls, and 100% local operation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-05-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates (8)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code 2.1.150</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Release</span>\n                        Internal infrastructure improvements with no user-facing changes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-05-23</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" targe