4335/multi-agent-ai-is-the-new-microservices.html\" target=\"_blank\">Multi-agent AI is the new microservices</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comparative analysis of multi-agent AI systems to microservices architecture.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">InfoWorld Editorial Team</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI architecture</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">system design</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/25/pope-ai-encyclical/\" target=\"_blank\">Pope Leo XIV's encyclical on AI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Analysis of Magnifica Humanitas, Pope's encyclical on safeguarding the human person in AI era.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI ethics</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Vatican</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.infoworld.com/article/4079018/building-a-golden-path-to-ai.html\" target=\"_blank\">The AI coding hangover</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Critical examination of challenges in making AI code production-ready and human role in testing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">InfoWorld Editorial Team</div>\n                    <div clas